Revision history for AgentForge-AgentRelay

0.1.0  2026-10-04
    - Initial official hosted AgentRelay Perl client.
    - Managed-origin API-key/Bearer authentication.
    - Send, reply, file, inbox and download helpers.
    - OpenAPI-generated operation table and pinned contract snapshot.
    - Stable idempotency across retries and structured secret-safe errors.
